  "system": {
    "identifier": "hanami-hanami-style-colossal-impact",
    "description": "<p>You drive your fist into the stomach of a creature with enough power to lift them off their feet, you then slam them into the ground with massive force.</p>\n<p>Make a melee ninjutsu (or taijutsu) attack, on a hit you deal your [Unarmed Damage] + 4d6 and each creature (excluding you and the original target) within 20 feet must make a Dexterity saving throw as you slam the original target into the ground. Affected creatures take 4d6 bludgeoning damage on a failed save or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>Finisher: The original target must make a Constitution saving throw, being Staggered and Bruised on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Monstrous Burst. Creatures within 5 feet of you when you cast this jutsu makes their saving throws at disadvantage.</p>\n<p>Healers Touch. Allied creatures within range are unaffected by the shockwave, and instead gain temporary hit points equal to half of the damage area of effect damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of the jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d6.</p>",
